      "created_at": "2025-09-18T18:16:09.913Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This issue happens because there is no <strong>dir</strong> attribute in the <strong>html tag for the web</strong></p>\n<p><strong>code in web</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=\"{{boot.lang}}\"&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/1/7186f7ee0c94e3471e23d4a53f4438121b17ca8b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7186f7ee0c94e3471e23d4a53f4438121b17ca8b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/1/7186f7ee0c94e3471e23d4a53f4438121b17ca8b.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gcj7BZC0y17B3pcE5rOAPTEbRMf\" width=\"468\" height=\"231\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">468×231 13.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-481056-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-481056-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>======================================</h2>\n<p>but it is <strong>available in the desk</strong><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/3/132fe8d8b282731a734cf87568e6efd7a237d262.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/132fe8d8b282731a734cf87568e6efd7a237d262\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/3/132fe8d8b282731a734cf87568e6efd7a237d262_2_690x162.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2JJIuNCR7WVxCuKUeyqJii2NRdg\" width=\"690\" height=\"162\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/3/132fe8d8b282731a734cf87568e6efd7a237d262_2_690x162.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/3/132fe8d8b282731a734cf87568e6efd7a237d262.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/3/132fe8d8b282731a734cf87568e6efd7a237d262.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F4F0F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1017×239 33.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>code in the desk</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=\"{{ lang }}\" dir=\"{{ layout_direction }}\"&gt;\n</code></pre>",
