      "cooked": "<p>To fix this issue you need to override the <strong>base.html</strong> file in<br>\n<em>apps/[your_custome_app]/[your_custome_app]/templates/base.html</em></p>\n<p>from this</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=\"{{boot.lang}}\"&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<p>to this</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=\"{{boot.lang}}\" dir=\"{{ 'rtl' if is_rtl() else 'ltr'}}\"&gt;\n</code></pre>",
